# 本目录直接文件说明

仅列出本目录文件；子目录内容请查看对应目录中的 `tree`。

- `amount.rs` — Conservative integer-fen parser for Arabic and Chinese notification amounts.
- `capture.rs` — Pending candidate construction and digest-based capture orchestration.
- `event.rs` — Minimal event shape passed from Android to Rust.
- `lib.rs` — Notification event and parser module declarations.
- `parse.rs` — Shared notification parsing and confidence handling.
- `providers.rs` — Payment app specific notification format parsers.
- `screen_capture.rs` — Local OCR payment success screen parser.
- `screen_capture_capture.rs` — Atomic persistence for screen OCR candidates.
- `tree` — 本目录直接文件的说明索引。
